{"version":2,"schema":"practice-question-chunk-v1","bank_id":"FUN10-V1-01","topic":{"id":"10-ham-so-do-thi","title":"Hàm số và đồ thị"},"questions":[{"id":"FUN10V1_001","question":"Cho \\(f(x)=2x+3\\). Giá trị \\(f(-2)\\) bằng bao nhiêu?","options":["\\(-1\\)","\\(0\\)","\\(-2\\)","\\(3\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"ham-so-do-thi","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-ham"],"type":"tinh-gia-tri-ham"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=-2\\) vào \\(f(x)=2x+3\\): \\(f(-2)=2\\cdot(-2)+3=-1\\)."},{"id":"FUN10V1_002","question":"Cho \\(f(x)=3x-1\\). Giá trị \\(f(0)\\) bằng bao nhiêu?","options":["\\(-1\\)","\\(0\\)","\\(-2\\)","\\(2\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"ham-so-do-thi","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-ham"],"type":"tinh-gia-tri-ham"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=0\\) vào \\(f(x)=3x-1\\): \\(f(0)=3\\cdot(0)-1=-1\\)."},{"id":"FUN10V1_003","question":"Cho \\(f(x)=-2x+4\\). Giá trị \\(f(2)\\) bằng bao nhiêu?","options":["\\(0\\)","\\(1\\)","\\(-1\\)","\\(4\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"ham-so-do-thi","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-ham"],"type":"tinh-gia-tri-ham"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=2\\) vào \\(f(x)=-2x+4\\): \\(f(2)=-2\\cdot(2)+4=0\\)."},{"id":"FUN10V1_004","question":"Cho \\(f(x)=x-5\\). Giá trị \\(f(-2)\\) bằng bao nhiêu?","options":["\\(-7\\)","\\(-6\\)","\\(-8\\)","Không đủ dữ kiện"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"ham-so-do-thi","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-ham"],"type":"tinh-gia-tri-ham"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=-2\\) vào \\(f(x)=x-5\\): \\(f(-2)=1\\cdot(-2)-5=-7\\)."},{"id":"FUN10V1_005","question":"Cho \\(f(x)=-3x+2\\). Giá trị \\(f(0)\\) bằng bao nhiêu?","options":["\\(2\\)","\\(3\\)","\\(1\\)","\\(-1\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"ham-so-do-thi","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-ham"],"type":"tinh-gia-tri-ham"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=0\\) vào \\(f(x)=-3x+2\\): \\(f(0)=-3\\cdot(0)+2=2\\)."},{"id":"FUN10V1_006","question":"Cho \\(f(x)=4x\\). Giá trị \\(f(2)\\) bằng bao nhiêu?","options":["\\(8\\)","\\(9